From 3c5c884936e9f254e0381b5b07b021f8139f7700 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sunwenxiang <sunwenxiang133@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 15:37:19 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add sophgo custom features to webui-vue

- Use aspeed's novnc fork (jpg support) with webpack WebAssembly config
- sophgo icons (sg2042 header logo, sophgo login logo), prettier off
- CPLD version card on Firmware page
- SOL port switching (UART0/UART1) + SOL log export on SOL console
- Inventory: hide DIMM/fans/PSU/assembly tables
- Fan speed control page (Settings > Fan speed)
- Network: DHCP enable switch
- 1684x board temperature display on Sensors page
